kanon 1

# Relatório de medição. Escrito em inglês canônico e sem nenhuma camada de idioma: o
# mesmo motor que produz uma escritura em português produz este documento, e nenhum dos
# dois pacotes sabe da existência do outro.

data
  study       : text    !
  instrument  : text    !
  operator    : text    !
  reviewer    : text
  effect      : measure !
  baseline    : measure !
  temperature : measure
  runs        : number  !
  caveat      : text
  dataset     : text    !
  date        : date    !

text

: title
# {study}

: summary
Across {runs} independent runs on the {instrument}, the estimated effect was {effect}, against a baseline of {baseline}[, at {temperature}].

@@ estimate
The reported effect is {effect}, whose relative uncertainty is {effect:relative}. Its central value is {effect:bare}, stated to the precision the uncertainty supports and not one digit beyond it.

@@@ resolution
The effect is resolved to better than one percent of its own value. The digits shown are the digits the measurement earned.

@@ subtraction
The baseline of {baseline} was measured under the same conditions and subtracted from every run before the effect was estimated.

@@ limitation
This report carries one caveat, and it is the following: {caveat}.

include "fragmentos/reprodutibilidade.kanon"

: closing
Prepared by {operator} on {date}[, reviewed by {reviewer}]. By {::estimate}, the value above is reported without further correction.

rules
  resolution  when effect is precise
  limitation  when caveat is present
